---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="404 — Solomzi" description="Page not found.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">ping: unknown host</span>
      <h1 aria-label="404: Destination unreachable">
        <span class="type-target" aria-hidden="true">404: Destination unreachable</span><span class="caret" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mono" style="color: var(--text-dim); max-width: 60ch;">
        $ traceroute {Astro.url.pathname}<br/>
        1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* * * request timed out<br/>
        2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* * * request timed out<br/>
        3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;destination host unreachable
      </p>
      <p>That page doesn't exist, or the route's gone stale. Let's get you back on the network.</p>
      <div class="hero-links">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/">Back home</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/blog">Browse lab notes</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>